flowchart TD
  A[AI request received] --> B{Cache hit?}
  B -- yes --> C[Return cached result]
  B -- no --> D{Quota ok?}
  D -- no --> E[Use mock/cached fallback or quota message]
  D -- yes --> F{Request type?}
  F -- meeting_extract/report/task_recommend --> G[AI API primary]
  F -- short_rewrite/summary_dev --> H[Ollama local if enabled]
  G --> I{Success within timeout?}
  H --> I
  I -- yes --> J[Validate JSON schema]
  I -- no --> K[Fallback mock/local/API alternate]
  K --> J
  J --> L{Valid and safe?}
  L -- no --> M[Return needs review / parse error]
  L -- yes --> N[Save draft + audit provider_used]
  N --> O[User review/confirm]
